          %h2#link Link
          %p
            Some further properties of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi 𝒥
                    %mn 2
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{J}_2
            are discussed in the answer to this
          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "https://mathoverflow.net/questions/396041/images-of-complemented-subobjects-in-hyperconnected-toposes-over-boolean-bases/396043?r=SearchResults&s=1|33.5942#396043"} MO-question
          %h2#references References
          %ul
            %li
